# Viewport testing

Do not override the user's current browser width unless testing a band. Micromobile = Galaxy S22 **360×780**. Gutters: `--gutter` / `--inset` (Tailwind `gutter` / `p-inset`). Full: `docs/agent/viewport-testing.md`.
